      * Title - Relay Message Log File
      * Created by C:136 for 114WYQ
      *====================================================
     A                                      REF(SREFP)
     A          R PRL01                     TEXT('Relay Msg Log File')
     A            RLCLM#        15A         COLHDG('Claim #')
     A            RLNAME       100A         COLHDG('Claimant Name')
     A            RLINJDT        7S 0       COLHDG('Date Of Injury')
     A            RLMSGDT        7S 0       COLHDG('Date Message Sent')
     A            RLDT           7S 0       COLHDG('Record Create Date')
     A            RLTIME         6S 0       COLHDG('Record Create Time')
     A            RLPGM         10A         COLHDG('Record Create' 'Program')
